    "detailed_description": "<strong>This game is a arcade block placing puzzle game added with some Tower Defense mechanics and strategy. </strong><br>Build and defend your fort, with your minigun and defenses against massive amounts of enemies and survive until the last wave.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935520/extras/0cf9ea870ca421781964f557109e0626.poster.avif?t=1726089140\" width=612 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935520/extras/0cf9ea870ca421781964f557109e0626.webm?t=1726089140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935520/extras/0cf9ea870ca421781964f557109e0626.mp4?t=1726089140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Build a fort!</strong> Stack physically simulated tetromino blocks on top of eachother to build forts high up in the sky. But don't let the blocks fall down or your fortress will collapse! The more blocks you have the more defenses you can maintain, so keep buying new ones.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935520/extras/e919bf61ec7d2ccf174302cc2d8fb810.poster.avif?t=1726089140\" width=612 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935520/extras/e919bf61ec7d2ccf174302cc2d8fb810.webm?t=1726089140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935520/extras/e919bf61ec7d2ccf174302cc2d8fb810.mp4?t=1726089140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Tear them apart!</strong> Shoot the incoming airships with a minigun to destroy them, before they explode infront of your tower and ruining your carefully placed blocks. Fight against ranged cannon airships, which shoot at your tower where it is most sensible, or ballons which attack your tower by letting bombs fall from above.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935520/extras/1aef18cc40fe15ba63cac6b50426c969.poster.avif?t=1726089140\" width=612 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935520/extras/1aef18cc40fe15ba63cac6b50426c969.webm?t=1726089140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935520/extras/1aef18cc40fe15ba63cac6b50426c969.mp4?t=1726089140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Bring out the big guns!</strong> Build Cannons in the sky, to defend your tower against the airships, or boost your economy by building windmills, so you can maintain or expand the defenses you've built.<br><br><br><strong>Skyfort leads you trough action-packed missions, in which you:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Build forts out of physically simulated tetromino blocks.<br></li><li>Fight against the different types of airship enemies.<br></li><li>Build up defenses to survive until the last wave of enemies.<br></li><li>Buy new blocks to be able to expand your tower and defenses.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>This game is a arcade block placing puzzle game added with some Tower Defense mechanics and strategy. </strong><br>Build and defend your fort, with your minigun and defenses against massive amounts of enemies and survive until the last wave.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935520/extras/0cf9ea870ca421781964f557109e0626.poster.avif?t=1726089140\" width=612 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935520/extras/0cf9ea870ca421781964f557109e0626.webm?t=1726089140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935520/extras/0cf9ea870ca421781964f557109e0626.mp4?t=1726089140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Build a fort!</strong> Stack physically simulated tetromino blocks on top of eachother to build forts high up in the sky. But don't let the blocks fall down or your fortress will collapse! The more blocks you have the more defenses you can maintain, so keep buying new ones.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935520/extras/e919bf61ec7d2ccf174302cc2d8fb810.poster.avif?t=1726089140\" width=612 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935520/extras/e919bf61ec7d2ccf174302cc2d8fb810.webm?t=1726089140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935520/extras/e919bf61ec7d2ccf174302cc2d8fb810.mp4?t=1726089140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Tear them apart!</strong> Shoot the incoming airships with a minigun to destroy them, before they explode infront of your tower and ruining your carefully placed blocks. Fight against ranged cannon airships, which shoot at your tower where it is most sensible, or ballons which attack your tower by letting bombs fall from above.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935520/extras/1aef18cc40fe15ba63cac6b50426c969.poster.avif?t=1726089140\" width=612 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935520/extras/1aef18cc40fe15ba63cac6b50426c969.webm?t=1726089140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935520/extras/1aef18cc40fe15ba63cac6b50426c969.mp4?t=1726089140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Bring out the big guns!</strong> Build Cannons in the sky, to defend your tower against the airships, or boost your economy by building windmills, so you can maintain or expand the defenses you've built.<br><br><br><strong>Skyfort leads you trough action-packed missions, in which you:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Build forts out of physically simulated tetromino blocks.<br></li><li>Fight against the different types of airship enemies.<br></li><li>Build up defenses to survive until the last wave of enemies.<br></li><li>Buy new blocks to be able to expand your tower and defenses.</li></ul>",
